<title>JAPAN: Tanabe Management - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tanabe Management - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.32		vs	    2.31</p>
<p> Operating	  190 million	 vs	  103 million</p>
<p> Current	    213 million	 vs	  153 million</p>
<p> Net		  155 million	 vs	  126 million</p>
<p> EPS		   17.72 yen	  vs	   15.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Tanabe Management Consulting Co Ltd operates management consulting clubs and is also a wholesaler of business notebooks.</p>
